// - Large magnitude: dead gradient only — sigma' saturated, random
//   starts break symmetry.
// - Symmetric (W=1): symmetric only — gradients flow fine, units
//   lockstep. Descends with capacity of one hidden unit.
// - Gaussian: neither — healthy.
